#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:81
#: e3f29de2c2f14aedb1e501ce317311cf
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:83
#: ae9e8a101b2c439686b846d57d862671
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default on SERIAL1 (USART1). PPM receivers are "
"*not* supported. The 4V5 pin is supplied by both USB and on board 5V BEC "
"from battery."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入默认配置在 SERIAL1（USART1）上。不支持 PPM 接收机。4V5 引脚由 USB 和板载 5V BEC（由电池供电）提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:85
#: dbb3ce3e41e34c22b4e08830198ae636
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:86
#: 840487f089b3472ab36060cde4aca6fc
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX1 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX1 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:87
#: 72d30333971a40f4b1073000cd7b0d93
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX1. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 7. See FPort Receivers."
msgstr ""
"FPort 需要连接到 TX1。设置 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 7。参见 FPort 接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:88
#: 148d604e61ee4cb8a73242ce21eed939
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX1 外还需要连接 TX1，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:89
#: 8157a8575d224cf1b0209d39555251e9
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" SERIAL6_OPTIONS to “4”."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要连接到 TX1 并自动提供数传。将 SERIAL6_OPTIONS 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:91
#: e1aca7a61ca74447ab5600781e5fe0e2
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also. See "
":ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr "在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可以用于 RC 系统连接。详见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

