"set :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1 for analog RSSI, = 3 for RSSI provided "
"by RC protocols such as CRSF."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1 用于模拟 RSSI，= 3 用于 CRSF 等 RC 协议提供的 RSSI。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:104
#: 0d4f7678675b42b08711a2cc1006dc13
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:106
#: 4decac3259904a0fb42126f206dec13a
msgid ""
"The Aocoda-RC H743Dual has an on-board OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` ="
"  1 (MAX7456 driver). The CAM and VTX pins provide connections for using the"
" internal OSD."
msgstr ""
"Aocoda-RC H743Dual 使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1（MAX7456 驱动）的板载 OSD。CAM 和"
" VTX 引脚提供使用内部 OSD 的连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:109
#: d585196f286c48e19734c3c1301c96dd
msgid "DJI Video and OSD"
msgstr "DJI 视频与 OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:111
#: ef4e05295cb74f108a1f915ead09f921
msgid ""
"An \"SH1.0 6P\" connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection and "
"SERIAL3 is already setup for this by default.  Pin 1 of the connector is 9V "
"so be careful not to connect this to any peripheral requiring 5V."
msgstr ""
"「SH1.0 6P」连接器支持标准 DJI HD VTX 连接，SERIAL3 已默认为此配置。连接器第 1 针为 9V，请注意不要将其连接到需要 5V"
" 的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:114
#: b01df6f7f632438a8b87c0c2292d50fa
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:116
#: b38a60cfb87b4ac799f15f085bda1bc1
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs 1-10 are Dshot, Bi-Directional DShot, and PWM "
"capable. However, mixing Dshot and normal PWM operation for outputs is "
"restricted into groups, ie. enabling Dshot for an output in a group requires"
" that ALL outputs in that group be configured and used as Dshot, rather than"
" PWM outputs."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出 1-10 均支持 DShot、双向 DShot 和 PWM。但是，在同一组内混合使用 DShot 和普通 PWM "
"受限——即在一组中为某个输出启用 DShot，该组所有输出都需配置并使用 DShot，而不能使用 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:118
#: 566eb8d6e81f40c199f4fe89b5c0d3ff
msgid ""
"The output groups that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured "
"as a normal servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4, 5/6/9/10, 7/8. Outputs 11/12 "
"(SE1/SE2) and 13 (LED) are in separate groups and are not Dshot capable."
msgstr ""
"必须使用相同输出类型（PWM 频率或 DShot，配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出分组为：1/2、3/4、5/6/9/10、7/8。输出 "
"11/12（SE1/SE2）和 13（LED）各属独立组，不支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:122
#: 7983698f8e554e8b8bcfe70c05e4a39f
msgid "GPIOs"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:124
#: 66257e29671a415dbb6429be250e6450
msgid ""
"The Aocoda-RC H743Dual outputs can be used as GPIOs (relays, buttons, RPM "
"etc). To use them you need to set the output's ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to -1. "
"See :ref:`common-gpios` page for more information."
msgstr ""
"Aocoda-RC H743Dual 的输出可用作 GPIO（继电器、按钮、转速计等）。使用时需将输出的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设置为"
" -1。详见 :ref:`common-gpios` 页面。"

