#: c279d6a750614a95bfb6dc448b85dcac
msgid "VTX Power Control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:147
#: f2117b63e4154375b8e6aea6e05110e6
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked “9V”. Setting this GPIO "
"low removes voltage supply to pins."
msgstr "GPIO 81 控制标记为 「9V」引脚的 VTX BEC 输出。将该 GPIO 置低则切断对这些引脚的供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:149
#: 6360eb237bed435c95f1630be8d1397c
msgid ""
"Set a RELAYx_PIN to “81” to control the switching. Then select an RC channel"
" for control (Chx) and set its RCx_OPTION to the appropriate Relay (1-6) "
"that you had set its pin parameter above."
msgstr ""
"将某个 RELAYx_PIN 设置为 「81」来控制切换。然后选择一个 RC 通道（Chx）并将其 RCx_OPTION "
"设置为上面设置了引脚参数的对应继电器（1-6）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:151
#: bdfe492757214c529bdf551affb0d782
msgid "For example, use Channel 10 to control the switch using Relay 2:"
msgstr "例如，使用第 10 通道通过继电器 2 控制开关："

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:153
#: 1381bca21f1f45b984646ce9438226e5
msgid ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = “81”"
msgstr ":ref:`RELAY2_PIN<RELAY2_PIN>` = 「81」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:155
#: 1b53c696a5594e00af9331ea62fda555
msgid ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = “34” (Relay2 Control)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC10_OPTION<RC10_OPTION>` = 「34」（继电器 2 控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:157
#: c14b248c4d6b4cf4a84609dafd836080
msgid ""
"PINIO1 is for 9V DC-DC control (HIGH:on; LOW:off). Default 9V DC is ON. "
"Please install an antenna on VTX when battery powered."
msgstr "PINIO1 用于 9V DC-DC 控制（HIGH：开；LOW：关）。默认 9V 直流为开启状态。电池供电时请在 VTX 上安装天线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:160
#: 5c4bcb1de92d4d8bac99997d1673171f
msgid "Connecting a GPS/Compass module"
msgstr "连接 GPS/罗盘模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:162
#: 7415a23af88947b4bae28d1aa8ffe134
msgid ""
"This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external "
"GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected in order "
"for autonomous modes to function."
msgstr ""
"此飞控不含 GPS 或罗盘，需连接 :ref:`外部 GPS/罗盘 <common-positioning-landing-page>` "
"方可使用自主飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:164
#: 54b6fb2c939c423fb9ca848fdb768eab
msgid ""
"If the GPS is attached to UART2 TX/RX and powered from the adjacent 5V pins,"
" a battery must be plugged in for power to be provided."
msgstr "如果 GPS 连接到 UART2 TX/RX 并由相邻的 5V 引脚供电，则必须插入电池才能供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:166
#: da6093662f844594b5a28a2d956dd0e5
msgid ""
"you could use the 4V5 pin to supply both the RC and the GPS without a "
"battery attached on the bench for setup as long as the total current does "
"not exceed the USB source (normally 1A on most computers)"
msgstr ""
"只要总电流不超过 USB 电源限制（大多数电脑通常为 1A），可以使用 4V5 引脚在不接电池的情况下在桌面同时为 RC 接收机和 GPS "
"供电以进行设置。"

