#: ../../source/docs/common-aocoda-h743dual.rst:193
#: efe901b35c394c18bcff40d1b73f9567
msgid ""
"this autopilot uses a high precision current sensor input which is sensitive"
" to ESC switching noise. Please check carefully before use that current "
"readings are accurate across the usage range. If not, low ESR capacitors on "
"the ESC power inputs may need to be added."
msgstr ""
"此飞控使用高精度电流传感器输入，对 ESC 开关噪声敏感。使用前请仔细检查，确保在整个使用范围内电流读数准确。如不准确，可能需要在 ESC "
"电源输入端添加低 ESR 电容。"

